          "text": "Site engineers considered salt exposure near the coast while preparing a capacity check for the airport navigation model. The model is viewed from the terminal observation window. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A cone has radius 8 cm and perpendicular height 6 cm. Find its volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
